"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seifert_surface\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dupin_cyclide\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/3-sphere\n"
"\n"
"Автор: Карстен Стегер; 2025 рік.\n"
"  "

